-black mb-3","children":"Bluetti Power Stations in Kenya"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-violet-100 text-lg max-w-3xl","children":"Shop genuine Bluetti portable power stations, residential & commercial backup systems (Homestar 3, Homestar 5, EP2000 10kW / 15kW / 20kW), solar panels and expansion batteries from Batteriq. Pay with M-Pesa, get Nairobi delivery, and receive local support for your backup-power setup."}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-8xl mx-auto px-4 lg:px-8 py-12","children":["$","$L1c",null,{"products":[{"id":"9735624a-820e-43b6-8c74-c23f1dcaa9dc","sku":"BLUETTI-HOMESTAR-3","brand":"Bluetti","category":"Solar Home Systems","subcategory":"Residential Backup","name":"Homestar 3 Solution","slug":"bluetti-homestar-3","description":"The Bluetti Homestar 3 solution pairs a 2kW inverter with 3kWh (3,014Wh) of LiFePO4 battery energy storage. An all-in-one residential backup system that keeps lights, fridge, WiFi, TV and phone charging running through KPLC outages in Kenya. Switches over automatically when the grid drops and recharges from mains or up to 2000W of solar.","specs":{"ac_output":"2kW Inverter","capacity":"3kWh Battery","chemistry":"LFP (LiFePO4)","solar_input":"2000W Max","voltage":"230V single-phase","type":"2kW Inverter + 3kWh Battery Storage"},"images":["/products/bluetti/bluetti-homestar-3.webp"],"price_kes":99000,"compare_price_kes":null,"discount_percent":null,"discount_badge":"NEW","in_stock":true,"stock_qty":10,"featured":true,"sort_order":80,"meta_title":"Buy Bluetti Homestar 3 Solution in Kenya — Price KES 111,500 | Batteriq","meta_description":"Buy the Bluetti Homestar 3 Solution in Kenya for KES 111,500. 2kW inverter + 3kWh battery energy storage. Authorised Bluetti dealer. M-Pesa payment. Nairobi delivery. Batteriq.","schema_rating":4.9,"schema_review_count":6,"created_at":"2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z"},{"brand":"Bluetti","category":"Solar Home Systems","subcategory":"Residential Backu